            <ArticleTitle>Psychological intervention in acute dental pain: review.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>337-43</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Acute dental pain is an unpleasant experience. This article studies acute dental pain and examines the role of psychological intervention. After identification of the psychological factors associated with dental pain we go on to assess the role of psychological interventions.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
